    "head_commit_message": "feat(formation): the native facing reads and writes the unit store\n\nSpec 35 step 4d. BodyField.face takes only the seek's squads, foes,\nunits and speeds: it reads where each unit stands, faces and makes for\nfrom the store's columns and its turn rate and backward pace from its\nrecord, and writes each bearing into the column there, as\nScrumFaceField's gather and write-back did in GDScript.\n\nTests: test_face_field.gd calls the facing on the field with only the\nsquads, foes, units and speeds (red on the 4c library); the facing\nparity tests run unchanged through the new path.\n\nWaived-by: Decision 142\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YWpV2AHWr3d2v4fKRki8G7",
